        "q": "What is the KPV + BPC-157 blend?",
        "a": "KPV + BPC-157 is a research-grade 2-component peptide pairing: KPV (lysine&ndash;proline&ndash;valine, the C-terminal tripeptide of &alpha;-MSH) + BPC-157 (Body Protection Compound, a gastric pentadecapeptide). The pairing targets gut healing and systemic inflammation through complementary mechanisms: KPV blocks NF-&kappa;B-mediated inflammatory signaling, while BPC-157 drives mucosal repair and angiogenesis. Both peptides can be dosed orally for gut-local action or subcutaneously for systemic exposure, which is a key practical advantage of this combination over purely injectable blends."
